<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Shall I not yield to that constraining power?</l><l>Shall I not say, O tide of love, flow in?</l><l>My God, Thy gentleness hath conquered me,</l><l>Life cannot be as it hath hither been.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Break through my nature, mighty, heavenly love,</l><l>Clear every avenue of thought and brain,</l><l>Flood my affections, purify my will,</l><l>Let nothing but Thine own pure life remain.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thus wholly mastered and possessed by God,</l><l>Forth from my life, spontaneous and free,</l><l>Shall flow a stream of tenderness and grace,</l><l>Loving, because God loved, eternally.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
